<template><div id="captions29" data-composition-id="captions29" data-width="1080" data-height="1920" data-duration="23.966666666667" style="position:relative;width:100%;height:100%"><div id="cap29-0" class="clip caption" data-start="0.000000000" data-duration="1.033333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>Si cada vez que apareces</p></div><div id="cap29-1" class="clip caption" data-start="1.033333333" data-duration="2.333333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>en mi pantalla intentas venderme algo</p></div><div id="cap29-2" class="clip caption" data-start="3.366666667" data-duration="2.733333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>probablemente voy a dejar de escucharte.</p></div><div id="cap29-3" class="clip caption" data-start="6.166666667" data-duration="1.233333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>Dame algo útil,</p></div><div id="cap29-4" class="clip caption" data-start="7.400000000" data-duration="2.100000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>cuéntame algo que no había pensado,</p></div><div id="cap29-5" class="clip caption" data-start="9.500000000" data-duration="2.100000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>ayúdame a solucionar un problema,</p></div><div id="cap29-6" class="clip caption" data-start="11.633333333" data-duration="1.133333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>porque cuando llegue el día</p></div><div id="cap29-7" class="clip caption" data-start="12.766666667" data-duration="2.233333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>en que necesite lo que tú vendes,</p></div><div id="cap29-8" class="clip caption" data-start="15.000000000" data-duration="1.233333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>yo ya debería saber quién eres</p></div><div id="cap29-9" class="clip caption" data-start="16.233333333" data-duration="1.066666667" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>y confiar en ti.</p></div><div id="cap29-10" class="clip caption" data-start="17.433333333" data-duration="1.500000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>La venta empieza mucho antes</p></div><div id="cap29-11" class="clip caption" data-start="18.933333333" data-duration="1.100000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>de pedir dinero.</p></div><div id="cap29-12" class="clip caption" data-start="20.033333333" data-duration="1.333333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>¿Qué podrías enseñar hoy</p></div><div id="cap29-13" class="clip caption" data-start="21.433333333" data-duration="1.100000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>sin intentar vender nada</p></div><div id="cap29-14" class="clip caption" data-start="22.533333333" data-duration="1.433333333" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p>a tus futuros clientes?</p></div></div><script>const root=document.querySelector('[data-composition-id="captions29"]');const tl=gsap.timeline({paused:true});tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-0 p"),{opacity:1},0.000000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-0 p"),{opacity:0},1.033333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-1 p"),{opacity:1},1.033333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-1 p"),{opacity:0},3.366666667);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-2 p"),{opacity:1},3.366666667);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-2 p"),{opacity:0},6.100000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-3 p"),{opacity:1},6.166666667);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-3 p"),{opacity:0},7.400000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-4 p"),{opacity:1},7.400000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-4 p"),{opacity:0},9.500000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-5 p"),{opacity:1},9.500000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-5 p"),{opacity:0},11.600000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-6 p"),{opacity:1},11.633333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-6 p"),{opacity:0},12.766666667);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-7 p"),{opacity:1},12.766666667);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-7 p"),{opacity:0},15.000000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-8 p"),{opacity:1},15.000000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-8 p"),{opacity:0},16.233333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-9 p"),{opacity:1},16.233333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-9 p"),{opacity:0},17.300000000);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-10 p"),{opacity:1},17.433333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-10 p"),{opacity:0},18.933333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-11 p"),{opacity:1},18.933333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-11 p"),{opacity:0},20.033333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-12 p"),{opacity:1},20.033333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-12 p"),{opacity:0},21.366666667);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-13 p"),{opacity:1},21.433333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-13 p"),{opacity:0},22.533333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-14 p"),{opacity:1},22.533333333);tl.set(root.querySelector("#cap29-14 p"),{opacity:0},23.966666667);window.__timelines.captions29=tl;</script></template>